                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "tl;dr: Graphics, Sound, Music, and Atmosphere are great and a definitely \"thumbs up\" but progression and especially the bosses are a huge \"thumbs down\". Can only recommend if you love the feeling of frustration and if you like unfair games with bad game design!\n\nLong version: I play videogames for over 30 years now and this is on of the most annoying, unfair and badly designed games I ever played. And no its not \"git gud\" and all that. This game is just unfair. I give credits to the dev, that you managed to make one of the most unfair bosses in gaming history, well made in every element, so you hate your life, yourself and every being on this planet while fighting them. Not because they are hard. This game just don't like to play by the rules. Example?\n\n\"Yeah you get this saw, its described as a weapon, but you can not damaged enemies with it. So you dont need it for bosses, right? RIGHT???\"\n\nNO! For some reason NOBODY understands, it works any time the devs want it to work. Did they tell you that? NO! And why didnt they tell you? Dont know, if I had to guess I would say devs hate their players. They dont want you to have fun, but you can suffer instead. If thats what you are into. No kink-shaming and all that.\n\nSo if you like to get constantly fooled by a game that isn't logical in ANY way and constantly change basic physical rules when the dev want it that way and if you HATE to have fun in a game, then this game is just for you! Cheers!",
